                <pb facs="0624" n="536" xml:id="pg536"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San Jose, Costa
                                Rica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-09-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Merry reports that the Salvadorean Congress ratified on the 22d instant the
                    agreement for the settlement of the arbitration of the Salvador Commercial
                    Company’s claim.)</p>
            </div>
